<span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴发布HappyHorse 1.1视频生成模型，实现多维度系统性升级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9b745cf2a41d7445aa11f595bddada02.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式发布视频生成模型HappyHorse 1.1，此次版本迭代在动态表现力、主体一致性、指令遵循、视觉质感及音频能力等核心维度实现系统性升级。相较于1.0版本，HappyHorse 1.1显著提升了视频生成的流畅度与动作连贯性，在多帧画面中能更稳定地保持主体一致性，并增强了对复杂指令的理解与执行能力。此外，该模型优化了视觉质感与音频同步效果，提供更具沉浸感的视听体验。目前，HappyHorse 1.1已全面接入HappyHorse官网、阿里云百炼及千问云平台，开发者、创作者及企业用户可直接调用。此次升级进一步强化了阿里巴巴在视频生成AI领域的工具能力，为用户提供更高效、细腻的视频内容创作支持。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果联手LM Studio实现四台Mac Studio集群本地运行万亿参数Kimi K2.6模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2d7c7a9825ff22e74d05c908ae8db973.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在WWDC2026上，苹果与LM Studio合作演示了利用四台Mac Studio组成的集群成功运行月之暗面万亿参数模型Kimi K2.6。该模型采用MoE架构，激活参数为320亿，支持长上下文、多模态及智能体任务。演示中，四台设备通过内存共享与互联技术实现约1.5TB统一内存，推理速度可达28 tokens/s，功耗显著低于传统GPU方案。此外，LM Studio推出的LM Link功能支持通过MacBook Neo及iPhone远程连接集群，利用端到端加密确保数据本地化处理，无需云端交互。此次技术演示验证了消费级硬件承载大规模AI推理的可行性，结合苹果Thunderbolt 5 RDMA等互联技术，标志着万亿参数模型本地化部署已进入工程落地阶段，为开发者提供了隐私安全且高性能的算力新路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米正式发布并开源全屋智能AI方案Miloco 2.0，实现家庭主动智能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f483c15c69bd60eef8497f9703d661f5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米正式发布并开源全屋智能AI方案Xiaomi Miloco 2.0，该方案基于自研MiMo大模型构建，以Agent形式接入OpenClaw框架，实现从规则触发向自主推理的底层逻辑重构。Miloco 2.0具备通用常识、身份识别、家庭记忆和家庭任务四大核心能力，支持通过人脸与体态识别区分家庭成员，并根据长期习惯沉淀主动决策，实现如加班关怀、复杂任务自主执行等主动智能场景。部署方面，该方案要求内存不低于4GB、存储不低于256GB，支持macOS与Linux系统，Windows用户需通过WSL运行，并需配置MiMo-v2.5系列模型API Key。配套的Web家庭面板可实时监控设备状态与历史日志。此次开源旨在推动全屋智能从被动响应向具备记忆、识人与执行能力的管家式主动服务演进，代码已在GitHub公开。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">京东开源实时视频交互模型JoyAI-VL-Interaction，实现主动式视觉交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/de6295ae976c57469aa7314bd7505888.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">京东正式开源实时视频视觉语言交互模型JoyAI-VL-Interaction，该模型获vLLM-Omni深度支持，标志着AI助手从“被动响应”转向“边看边说”的自主观察模式。JoyAI-VL-Interaction具备持续观察视频流的能力，能智能判断交互时机，实现画面变化与智能响应的同步。技术亮点在于“后台委托”机制，模型可将代码生成、复杂推理等任务分流至后台Agent系统，确保前台观察与交互并行。该模型支持摄像头、直播流及监控信号等多种输入源，并允许开发者灵活替换ASR、TTS及外部API接口。在涵盖监控预警、实时翻译等58个流式场景的盲评测试中，该模型表现优异。此开源方案为安防监控、电商导购、AI眼镜等产业级应用提供了具备高实时性的技术基座，有效解决了传统“先上传、后分析”模式的滞后问题。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与三星电子达成合作，12万员工全面接入ChatGPT企业版及Codex</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日与三星电子达成史上最大规模企业级部署合作，向三星全球超12万名员工提供ChatGPT企业版及Codex开发平台。此次部署覆盖韩国本土全体员工及设备体验（DX）部门全球员工，涉及软件开发、市场营销、产品制造等核心业务。三星员工将利用ChatGPT进行信息检索、数据分析与文档撰写，并借助Codex实现业务流程自动化。OpenAI强调，ChatGPT企业版在数据保护、权限管理及安全控制方面进行了强化，确保符合企业治理框架。Codex目前周活跃用户已超500万，其中韩国地区增长显著。除软件应用外，双方还将在下一代AI基础设施所需的高端存储半导体供应领域深化协作。此次合作标志着三星将AI从局部工具升级为全球战略平台，进一步推动了企业级AI应用的规模化落地。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
